(text "MCU STM32U585 + LIAISON DJI PSDK" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "32932310-e1ab-4144-81f0-17cea5d77096"))
(text "STM32U585CIU6 : Cortex-M33 160 MHz, 2 Mo flash, 786 Ko RAM, 19 uA/MHz, TrustZone + AES/PKA materiels." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c74defa3-b635-45fb-94d1-a8bcb4ca3804"))
(text "PSDK : DJI fournit la lib precompilee armcc_cortex-m33 -> compilation Keil MDK (Arm Compiler 6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9103b767-b27d-4317-bb81-bc6896b493f9"))
(text "USART1 (PA9/PA10) 921600 bauds vers le kit E-Port V2 ; R14/R15 = protection du cable." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a4170ca2-6c3b-4194-856b-657f432c4abb"))
(text "Horloge : MSI calibre en PLL sur LSE 32,768 kHz (+/-0,25 %) -> pas de quartz HSE ; quartz CL 7 pF, C = 10 pF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 39 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1fc737ff-f39d-41eb-ad16-4f590f996ebc"))
(text "ADC1 : PA0 VIN, PA1 I_HOLD, PA2 I_LED, PA3 I_EJECT. PWM : TIM1_CH1 maintien, TIM2_CH1 ejection, TIM15_CH1 LED. PB12 ARM." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dde867d3-95f6-4d3e-9f1f-591941457b47"))
